      "source_xml_line": 482,
      "string_id": "borch_travel_dialog_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No, I'm not taking anyone over to the bandits; we're on thin ice with them. How about I take you to the abandoned gas station? You got a couple of boar hooves? I'm a little short on trophies and I can take payment that way. And if not, then give me four and a half thousand rubles - then I'll drive you.",
